						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#302">Prystine and Qwisatz Missing</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Attention all Watchers Ten members!!!<br />
<br />
Be on the lookout for two missing members of the Watchers Ten.<br />
<br />
Prystine was last spotted at a Naggy raid.  I am afraid her charm and song was not enough to keep her alive from the bloodstained teeth of Naggy.  Some believe her remains will not be found and that her soul has been transported to another relm.  Rumors spread of this relm one that rivals the splendor of Norath.  The relm I speak of is known by few as DAoC.  <br />
<br />
In the loss of her friend Qwisatz was bound and determined to keep their souls together as she has found a means of transfering her soul to the relm of DAoC.<br />
<br />
I only pray for us the Watchers Ten that we keep our heads high and continue on.  We shall meet Prystine and Qwisatz again I can feel it so.<br />
<br />
I will be calling on all my powers to bring them back to the world we know as Norath.<br />
<br />
Keep Faith Alive<br />
signed<br />
Stoniana Avendesora<br />
Pathfinder of the Watchers Ten<br />
<br />
<br />
/ooc I just talked to Jeff.  He has been engrossed in DAoC pulling Janete in with him.  It is just a matter of time before they return..hehe
