						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#299">Fish Smell Attacks Freeport</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Reports say that a pungent odor has started attacking Freeport.  I was really worried one day as I was making my way to the Bank of North Freeport. I decided to turn on my tracking .... there is was &quot;Fishy Odor&quot; on track.  Me being the conserned citizen that I followed my nose as well as using my keen sense of tracking to the Docks.  Then all of the sudden I noticed what was eminating the foul odor.  &quot;Viola&quot;  Pristine was busy washing her Bedsheets in the bay.  I could not report a fellow member of the Watchers Ten to the Freeport Militia so I handed Prsytine a bottle of &quot;Ole Summers Eve&quot;  I know it makes me fresh so maybe it will kill Prystine's fishy odor.  <br />
<br />
Another problem solved by Stoniana Avensdora Pathfinder of the Watchers Ten.<br />
<br />
/ooc  Sorry I had to put something in here was getting tired of not having any news when I checked the web site.
